            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Forge Pro 1.0.1</h2>
<p>Build 202608281455 · stable channel</p>
<ul>
<li>Third-party notices now include the Swift packages linked into the app (swift-markdown, swift-cmark) and ship with the iOS app as well.</li>
<li>Settings › General gains the automatic-updates toggle with the current channel and a Check for Updates button.</li>
<li>The update channel chosen in Settings is honoured from launch; changes made by the updater itself are reflected in Settings.</li>
<li>Release pipeline hardening: signed Sparkle helper tools, notarization fixes, non-arm64 native prebuilds pruned, a build number that can only increase, and older releases keep their download links.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
